'''Micheal Tallstrider''' was a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found in [[Sacred Glade]]. He frantically runs up to the player, he was glad they made it through the [[Warpstones|warpstone]] before it was destroyed by the [[Robgoblins|robgoblins]]. Micheal needs the player to help chasing the creatures off.
